  _udonSharpBackingUdonBehaviour: {fileID: 6786357287088672984}
  Wreck: {fileID: 8160080280432474560}
  AceName: MISTER.S
  SpeakerColor: {r: 1, g: 0.74, b: 0.32, a: 1}
  Chatter: {fileID: 0}
  Voice: {fileID: 0}
  Contacts: {fileID: 0}
  VoiceQueueDelay: 8
  ChatterGap: 20
  FlareLineCooldown: 25
  LineSpawn: You trespass on land my family has held for three centuries. I shall
    see you off it myself.
  LineSunMissile: Follow me into the light, if you dare.
  LineSunLure: The sun has always favoured my house.
  LineGlare: Your missile bows to the sun. As it should.
  LineReverse: Manners, young one. One does not shoot a gentleman in the back.
  LineFlare: Too slow, I'm afraid.
  LineHalf: There are pilots like you in every generation. And I've felled every
    last one of them.
  LineDown: Ah... it seems the time has come to pass it on to the next generation.
  AwacsRail: He turned on a dime! Don't chase him into the sun!
  AwacsHalf: He's hit, but nothing vital! He keeps turning his engines and cockpit
    away from our fire. He's doing damage control by flying!
  ClipSpawn: {fileID: 8300000, guid: 736610f339868054bacb3e637c23ccb2, type: 3}
  ClipSunMissile: {fileID: 8300000, guid: ae74eaed845a11448881bc4e70e4dd65, type: 3}
  ClipSunLure: {fileID: 8300000, guid: a6053b0b3b3d1124880738aa2ef90a68, type: 3}
